WEBVTT

00:00:04.024 --> 00:00:06.440
The system would enrich the

00:00:06.440 --> 00:00:07.960
prospect, it would research,

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:09.960
it goes to each prospect,

00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:11.850
it does a complete research,

00:00:11.980 --> 00:00:13.320
tells us why this person

00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:14.650
may be relevant for us,

00:00:15.060 --> 00:00:16.460
gives us the signals and

00:00:16.460 --> 00:00:18.140
the outreach angles that we

00:00:18.140 --> 00:00:19.180
can do.

00:00:19.180 --> 00:00:20.350
Now the emails

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:22.620
are being generated by the

00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:24.360
system based on the research

00:00:24.360 --> 00:00:25.500
and based on what it

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:26.790
learned about your service

00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:29.750
and it creates the emails.

00:00:32.180 --> 00:00:33.100
And it could either be

00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:35.960
when a user fills up

00:00:35.960 --> 00:00:37.280
a form on your website

00:00:37.280 --> 00:00:39.640
and then the voice agent

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:41.262
immediately calls him.

00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:41.780
Thanks for calling

00:00:41.780 --> 00:00:42.640
MeetingScheduled.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:43.820
How can I help you

00:00:43.820 --> 00:00:44.370
today?

00:00:44.408 --> 00:00:45.640
MeetingScheduled builds digital

00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:46.860
phone receptionists for

00:00:46.860 --> 00:00:48.940
businesses, so your calls can

00:00:48.940 --> 00:00:50.250
be answered automatically,

00:00:50.340 --> 00:00:51.640
even after hours or when

00:00:51.640 --> 00:00:52.520
your team is busy.

00:00:52.520 --> 00:00:53.860
This is the Speed Dialer

00:00:53.860 --> 00:00:55.840
app where you are able

00:00:55.840 --> 00:00:57.760
to call, email,

00:00:57.760 --> 00:00:59.690
WhatsApp, look at the company.

00:01:00.460 --> 00:01:01.260
once I do the call

00:01:01.260 --> 00:01:03.340
I'm able to see my

00:01:03.340 --> 00:01:05.210
recent calls you

00:01:05.784 --> 00:01:07.160
download them to see the

00:01:07.160 --> 00:01:09.060
transcript of each one When

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:11.100
we click on one of

00:01:11.100 --> 00:01:13.910
the leads we've spoken with,

00:01:13.920 --> 00:01:16.330
we can hear the recordings.

00:01:17.304 --> 00:01:18.540
We can see the transcript

00:01:18.540 --> 00:01:20.630
directly here,
